        <span class="section-badge section-badge--g02">Model-Agnostic</span>
        <h2 class="heading-serif feature-heading">Bring your own bot.</h2>
        <p class="feature-sub">
          Your Claude, Cursor, and Codex, organized under one org structure, pointed at one goal.
          If it can receive a heartbeat, it's hired.
